WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Proportion and stance. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Compare wheelbase, track and overhang

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: Proportion compares dimensions such as wheelbase, track, cabin height and overhang. State the view and measurement convention.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: On a side drawing, compare front and rear overhang to wheelbase as ratios instead of relying on a cropped photograph.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Measured-overlay comparison

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: A view supports interpretation; it cannot prove hidden structure or compliance alone.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Compare wheelbase, track and overhang
